"أنحاء الإمارات."

#. module: techrise_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:techrise_website.erp_retail_page
msgid ""
"Techrise reviews your setup against current guidance, cleans the data that "
"invoices depend on, and plans the integration with you so you are not "
"scrambling when your turn comes. Requirements differ by business size and "
"sales type, so we confirm the details with you during discovery instead of "
"promising a one-size-fits-all switch."
msgstr ""
